<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner in Chilean methanol project.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner in Chilean methanol project.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Norwegian industrial group Kvaerner ASA said on Thursday that Kvaerner John Brown would build a methanol plant in Chile for 2.2 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The plant, to be constructed for Methanex, will be completed in 1999, Kvaerner said in a brief statement to the Oslo Bourse.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
